# Build context is the repository root (see apps/api/Dockerfile). Keep it small.
.git
.github
docs
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.exemple
**/*.md
**/openapi.json
**/temp

# Only the manifest of the other workspaces is needed, for the lockfile check in `npm ci`.
apps/mobile/*
!apps/mobile/package.json
packages/api-client/*
!packages/api-client/package.json
